      "releaseNotes": "Made for iPhone Duo and iOS 27. Lines now size themselves to whichever screen you're holding, inner or outer. Plus 100 new real quotes: Jane Austen on income, Ambrose Bierce's Devil's Dictionary, Pooh on doing Nothing, Buffett and Munger on money. Still no ads.",
      "primaryGenreName": "Entertainment",
